 ('b','Set the fitted stopping voltage tozero rather than reading the horizontal axis origin. Xthreshold=2.09677 and λthreshold476.923nm.',lambda:(c('Photoemission threshold scaled reciprocal wavelength',2.600/1.240,2.09677419354839,1e-12),c('Photoemission threshold wavelength',1/(1e6*(2.6/1.24)),4.76923076923077e-7,1e-19,'m'))),
